msgid ""
"**Basic Joint Controller** joint-position FSM (HOME / HOLD / MOVEJ). "
"`/fsm_command` is `std_msgs/Int32` — on mixed OCS2/WBC stacks `3` means "
"**OCS2**; canonical MOVEJ is `4`."
msgstr ""
"**Basic Joint Controller** 关节位置 FSM（HOME / HOLD / MOVEJ）。`/fsm_command` 是"
" `std_msgs/Int32` — 混合 OCS2/WBC 栈上 `3` 表示 **OCS2**；规范 MOVEJ 是 `4`。"

